AFAIK, Demogorgon can only appear when he is summoned (at least in
vanilla NetHack; apparently he has his own plane in SLASH'EM...
*shudder*). Orcus, Juiblex and Yeenoghu can summon Demogorgon. The
"summon nasties" spell can gate in a demon prince/lord in Gehennom, but
you get a message ("A monster appears from nowhere" or something like
that). Also, the Wizard can occasionally "send nasties" instead of
resurrecting; this works pretty much the same way, but with no message.
I'd hazard a guess that this last option is what has happened to you,
since there is a message for "summon nasties", and I presume you would
have noticed one of the other demon princes/lords skulking around!

